//
// SIX BYTES A STAR: right ascension as an unsigned 16-bit fraction of a turn,
// declination as a signed 16-bit fraction of a quarter turn, apparent magnitude
// and colour index as bytes. That is 53KB, or 71KB once base64 has had its way,
// against the 34MB the full catalogue arrives as. The precision is 0.0055
// degrees in right ascension and 0.0027 in declination, which is finer than a
// pixel of the sky texture and far finer than an eye can tell.
//
